s9::eqid |- ( x e. ( 0 ..^ ( U x. V ) ) |-> <. ( x mod U ) , ( x mod V ) >. ) = ( x e. ( 0 ..^ ( U x. V ) ) |-> <. ( x mod U ) , ( x mod V ) >. )
s10:s7,s8,s9,s1:crth |- ( ( ( U e. NN /\ V e. NN /\ ( U gcd V ) = 1 ) /\ ( F : ( 0 ..^ U ) --> CC /\ G : ( 0 ..^ V ) --> CC ) ) -> ( x e. ( 0 ..^ ( U x. V ) ) |-> <. ( x mod U ) , ( x mod V ) >. ) : ( 0 ..^ ( U x. V ) ) -1-1-onto-> ( ( 0 ..^ U ) X. ( 0 ..^ V ) ) )
